{
 "about": "Every NPC in the town: one entry per character, its permanent id first (unique, lowercase, never reused or changed once saves can refer to it: profile avatars, outfits, quests). Guide and how to add one: docs/guides/NPCS.md. Read by scripts/characters/npc_registry.gd (placement, lookups), house_characters.gd (the cast: profile avatars, Home seats), the minigame sessions that make their NPCs at run time, and npc_chatter.gd (idle lines). Coordinates: 'at' and 'back' are TOWN coordinates (Main's Apartment node: +X west, +Z north, Apartment scale 1.3 applies, so 1 unit = 1.3 m in the world); 'facing' is the direction the NPC looks in the same frame, an [x, z] vector or an axis name (+x, -x, +z, -z). placement: 'house' = seated or lying in the Home by house_characters.gd ('at' is the seat or mattress surface; optional 'back' an [x, z] point on the backrest); 'scene' = baked into its unit scene at 'node' (a path under the town root); npc_registry.gd moves it to 'at' / 'facing' at load ('at' is the node's origin, the floor between its feet; a seated node keeps its seated pose), so the registry wins over the baked transform; 'registry' = made at load by npc_registry.gd under the unit part named by 'node' ('at' is the floor it stands on), never baked; 'runtime' = made by the 'owner' script (a minigame); the script reads scene, costume and name from here; 'cast' = not placed in the town (an avatar and random customer only). role: 'host' (runs 'activity', data/activities.json), 'ambient' (no activity), 'customer'. word: the data/words.json key the NPC teaches when clicked or talked to (people words). chatter: the idle-line group (data/phrases.json 'chatter.<group>_<n>', see 'chatter_groups'). cast: true = a profile avatar and tutorial stand-in (in data order; 'costume' is then its own look as an avatar, stand-in or customer, and 'work_costume' what it wears where it is placed in the town); in_house false keeps it out of the Home (its home_seat is kept), picker false leaves it off the new-player grid. Folded in from data/house_characters.json on 23 Nov 2026 (user: one registry for all NPCs).",
